    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakūlūye ba ng'wa Yosefu kūja Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo akigwa gīkī shilīko shilīwa ī Misili, ūbawīla a bitūnja bakwe, “Nibūlī mukwilola lolaga dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongeja kūhaya, “Nigwile gīkī shilīko shilīwa ī Misili, jagi koi mukatūsumīle, tūpīle; tūtizūnanuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo būbūūka ikūmi, būja ī Misili ū kūsuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yakobo akaneka ū Benjamini, ū nzūnaye wa ng'wa Yosefu, atantūmile ū kūja nabo a bakūlūye; nguno akogoha atizūgwīlwa mhayo gwabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bitūnja ba ng'wa Isilaeli būbūūka bajile hamò na bangī abo bajaga kūgūla shilīwa, nguno yalīho nzala nī Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū Yosefu walī ntaale ū mu sī yenīyo, hū ng'wene wabajingījaga ī shilīwa a banhū ba mu sī yenīyo. Na lūūlū a bakūlūye aho bashika binama ū kū būtongi bokwe, kūshisha ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho wababona a bakūlūye ūbadeeba, alīyo wiyīta kūbiza gītī atūbamanaga; ūbayombya n'ilaka lyayī alībabūja, “Ng'wafumaga halī a bing'we?” Būnshokeja, “Twafumaga sī ya Kanaani, twizaga kūgūla shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi batang'witegelegije, nūūlū īkī ū wei ū Yosefu walī wabadeeba a bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūshizūkwa ī shilooti shakwe ūmo walī wabalootela kale; ūbawīla, “A bing'we mulī badati, ng'wizaga kwīlola ī sī yise, mubone aho īlī na būgokolo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja, “Yaya gete baba nkūjiwa, a bise basese bako twizaga kūgūla shilīwa dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bose tūlī baana ba myaji ūmò; tūlī banhū ba mhola gete a bise basese bako, tūtī badati yaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Yaya a bing'we ng'wizaga kwīlola dūhū ī sī yise, mubone aho būlī ū būgokolo wayo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būnshokeja balīhaya, “A bise basese bako tūlī banhū ba shikūlū na shizuna, twalī ikūmi na babīlī; banhū ba myaji ūmò muna Kanaani, ūyo nī haha alīko ū kū sī yenīyo. Ū kwangū wise alī kaya hamò na sīwe, alīyo ūmò wise atīho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Yosefu ūbakaanīlīja alībawīla, “Angū h'ūmo nalīmuwīlīla, gīkī mūlī badati a bing'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūmanīka dūhū. Nitonga; būta Falao mutīngaga gete a henaha kūshisha ize aha ū nzuna wing'we ū kwangūlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntūmagi ūmò wing'we aje akang'wenhe ū nzuna wing'we. A bangī pyī mukūlugalīlwa mu jeela, īdīlīlwe ī mihayo ying'we, mubonwe ūlū ninga mulīhaya ya ng'hana. Ūlū mubize mutūhayaga ya ng'hana; ū nene nitongaga mu lina lya ng'wa Falao, managi gīkī mukūbalwa kūbiza mulī badati!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbalugalīla a bose mu jeela ikanza lya shikū idatū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaho, ū Yosefu ūbawīla gīkī, “Bing'we ītagi gūyū mhayo hū mukwikala bapanga, nguno ū nene nang'ogohile Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulī banhū ba ng'hana, ūmò wing'we asaage aha mu jeela; a bangī muje kaya, mutwale shilīwa ū kū kaya jing'we jitizūnanulwa nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo shiigelile mung'wenhe ū nzuna wing'we, hū mukūmanīka gīkī mulīhaya ya ng'hana, hama mutūcha!” Na ng'hana h'ūmo bakīītīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bandya kwiwīla gīkī, “A makoye genaya galītūgwīla kūlwa nzuna wise, nguno twagūloleelaga gete aho watwiyandīlaga kūlwa būpanga bokwe, alīyo twalī tūtandegelekaga; h'ī nguno yene a makoye genaya gatūgwīlaga ī haha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lubeni ūbawīla, “Naalī natamuwīlaga gīkī nekagi ū nyanda mutizūng'wītīla yabūbi; alīyo ng'ūlema ū kūnidegeleka? Al'ī haha lūūlū angū mulībona gīkī galīkoowa a mininga gakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi baalī batamanaga gīkī ū Yosefu wīdeebaga īyo bīhayaga, nguno watūmamīlaga nshomeleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgalūka ūja hanhū ūkalīla kakanza, alīyo ūshoka hangī wandya kūbayombya. Wanoga nose ūnsola ū Simioni, ūlagīla atungwe balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūlagīla gīkī a magūnīla gabo gokajiwe shilīwa, nī hela jabo bashokejiwe, būlī munhū atūūlilwe ū ng'wigūnīla lyakwe; na gīkī binhwe mhamba ja mu nzīla, pyī ī yenīyo bakīītīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būjitungīlīja ī nzobe jabo ī miligo, būbūūka bajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshika ha ng'hambī ya kūlaala ū būjikū wenūbo, ūmò wabo ūtaligūla ū nigo gwakwe gīkī asole shilīwa sha kūlisha nzobe yakwe; ūjisanga ī hela jakwe ū ng'wigūnīla; jalī jatūūlwa haho nomo gwigūnīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla a biye gīkī, “Bagosha ī hela jane jashoshiagwa, jiiji jilī ng'wigūnīla.” Ī myoyo yabo īkibakīla no; bandya kūdetema kūnū bakwilola lolaga, baliwīla, “Bing'we babbehi, ū Mulungu watwītīlaga mhayo kī hangī nago ū gwenūyū?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnsomboolela saabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika ī kaya ī Kanaani ū kūlī saabo, būnsomboolela pyī īyo yalī yabagwīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla, “Ū ntaale wa sī yenīyo walūyombaga nise mu būkalī no; nīyo walūtwisaabaga gīkī tūlī badati ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo tūng'wīla gīkī, ‘A bise tūlī banhū ba mhola dūhū tūtī badati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twal'ikūmi na babīlī, banhū ba myaji ūmò ba shikūlū na shizuna. Gwike ūmò wise atīho ū kū welelo, hama ū nzuna wise ū kwangūlīja mu kūbyalwa, alī Kanaani hamò na sīswe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ū ntaale wa sī, ūtūwīla; ‘Ī nzīla ya kūmudeeba gīkī mulī banhū ba ng'hana yīyī, nekagi ng'wana wa ng'wing'we ūmò hamò nane aha, a bangī jagi mutwale shilīwa ū kū kaya jing'we jitizūnanulwa nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo mukanenhele ū nzuna wing'we ū wa kūmalīīja; hū nakūmana gīkī ng'hana mutī badati, mulī banhū ba ng'hana. A henaho hū nakūmushokeja ū ndūgū wing'we, hama mukūbiza na wiyaabī wa ū mu sī īyī.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bandya kūgafugunhūla a magūnīla gabo, būjisanga ī hela jabo jilīmo pye, būlī munhū na hela jakwe ū mu nigo gwakwe! Aho bajibona īmbogoshija ya hela boogoha no; pye nū saabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū saabo ū Yakobo ūbawīla gīkī, “A bing'we mulīnimalīla a baana bane; ū Yosefu alīndūhū kū welelo, nū Simioni nū ng'wene atīho; hama hangī ī haha mulīhaya kūntwala nū Benjamini. Pyī ī mibi yenīyī īlīnigwīla nene dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Lubeni ūng'wīla ū ise gīkī, “Ntūūlage mu nkono gwane baba nakūnshosha; ūlū nūleka kūng'wenha na kwiza kūbatūūla mu makono gako, a bitūnja bane būbīlī wabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yakobo ūhaya dūhū gīkī, “Ū ng'wanone atī wa kūja hamò ning'we ū kwenūko; nguno ū nkūlūye wazumalīka nūlekelwa ng'wenūyū dūhū. Ūlū mhayo gose gose gwabūbi gūūkang'wilongela ū mu lūgendo ūlo mulīja, mukūnibūlaga na būpīna, nīyo ū būnamhala bone ūmo nalī ūmu, angū numho ng'wanihilimīkīja mu shigila gete!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
